1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:03,855
Ek demo jo ek baar
chal jaaye, woh aasaan hai.

2
00:00:04,075 --> 00:00:09,971
Lekin ek program jo network girne par,
rate limit aane par, ya cost badhne par bhi

3
00:00:09,971 --> 00:00:14,358
chalta rahe, uske liye soch
samajhkar design karna padta hai.

4
00:00:14,578 --> 00:00:20,046
Yeh lesson woh production basics
sikhata hai jo har AI application ko chahiye.

5
00:00:21,346 --> 00:00:26,332
Aap API ke error types
pehchanoge, aur har ek ke liye kya karna hai.

6
00:00:26,682 --> 00:00:29,414
Errors ko sahi order mein catch karoge.

7
00:00:29,764 --> 00:00:32,912
Rate limits aur
automatic retries samjhoge.

8
00:00:33,262 --> 00:00:36,819
Aur har call ki cost
calculate aur control karoge.

9
00:00:38,119 --> 00:00:40,811
Pehle what: kaun kaun se errors aate hain.

10
00:00:41,031 --> 00:00:45,182
HTTP status code batata
hai ki problem kis taraf hai.

11
00:00:45,532 --> 00:00:49,220
Four hundred ya four oh
four: aapki request galat hai.

12
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:53,941
Koi galat parameter, ya model
ka naam jo exist hi nahi karta.

13
00:00:54,161 --> 00:00:57,473
Retry se kuch nahi
hoga, request theek karo.

14
00:00:57,823 --> 00:01:00,877
Four oh one aur four
oh three: key ki problem.

15
00:01:01,097 --> 00:01:03,995
Key missing hai, galat
hai, ya permission nahi hai.

16
00:01:04,215 --> 00:01:06,518
Retry mat karo, key theek karo.

17
00:01:06,868 --> 00:01:10,213
Four twenty nine: aapne
rate limit cross kar di.

18
00:01:10,433 --> 00:01:13,577
Yahan rukna aur retry
karna bilkul sahi hai.

19
00:01:13,927 --> 00:01:19,777
Five hundred wale errors, five twenty
nine overloaded bhi, server side problems

20
00:01:19,777 --> 00:01:21,407
hain, aksar temporary.

21
00:01:21,627 --> 00:01:23,718
Thoda rukkar retry karo.

22
00:01:24,068 --> 00:01:28,491
Aur network errors ya timeouts:
koi proper response aaya hi nahi.

23
00:01:28,711 --> 00:01:30,945
Yeh bhi retry karne layak hain.

24
00:01:32,245 --> 00:01:33,141
Ab how.

25
00:01:33,361 --> 00:01:39,090
Sirf iss demo ke liye hum automatic
retries band karte hain, taaki har error hamare

26
00:01:39,090 --> 00:01:40,332
code tak pahunche.

27
00:01:40,682 --> 00:01:42,712
Call ek try block ke andar hai.

28
00:01:43,062 --> 00:01:48,189
Phir hum specific exception classes
catch karte hain, sabse specific pehle.

29
00:01:48,409 --> 00:01:51,885
Pehle authentication
error, phir rate limit error.

30
00:01:52,235 --> 00:01:58,380
API status error har HTTP error ki
parent class hai, toh jo bacha hai woh yeh pakad

31
00:01:58,380 --> 00:02:00,674
leti hai, status code ke saath.

32
00:02:00,894 --> 00:02:06,012
Connection errors HTTP errors hain
hi nahi, isliye unki alag class hai.

33
00:02:06,232 --> 00:02:11,697
Agar parent class pehle catch karoge,
toh specific handlers kabhi chalenge hi nahi.

34
00:02:12,047 --> 00:02:16,309
Bina kisi failure ke, ek
normal placeholder reply aata hai.

35
00:02:16,529 --> 00:02:18,201
Right side par wahi hai.

36
00:02:19,501 --> 00:02:25,546
Bina kuch tode errors dikhane ke liye,
fake API ek environment variable padhti hai,

37
00:02:25,546 --> 00:02:28,314
jo batata hai ki kaise fail karna hai.

38
00:02:28,664 --> 00:02:32,414
Four oh one ka message
banta hai: check your API key.

39
00:02:32,764 --> 00:02:35,270
Four twenty nine ka: rate limited.

40
00:02:35,620 --> 00:02:41,360
Aur five twenty nine, overloaded server,
general status handler tak pahunchta hai.

41
00:02:42,660 --> 00:02:47,922
Rate limit ka matlab: har account ke
liye ek limit hai ki ek minute mein kitni

42
00:02:47,922 --> 00:02:50,621
requests aur kitne tokens bhej sakte ho.

43
00:02:50,841 --> 00:02:53,963
Limit cross hui, toh
four twenty nine aata hai.

44
00:02:54,183 --> 00:02:58,104
Iska solution samjho ek
busy dost ko call karne se.

45
00:02:58,324 --> 00:02:59,686
Line busy hai.

46
00:02:59,906 --> 00:03:02,531
Aap har second redial nahi karte.

47
00:03:02,751 --> 00:03:06,211
Thoda rukte ho, aur har
baar thoda zyada rukte ho.

48
00:03:06,431 --> 00:03:11,967
Aur agar hazaar log yahi kar rahe hain,
toh thodi randomness unhe ek hi second par

49
00:03:11,967 --> 00:03:13,992
wapas call karne se rokti hai.

50
00:03:15,292 --> 00:03:16,741
Dry run dekho.

51
00:03:16,961 --> 00:03:18,887
Try one: four twenty nine.

52
00:03:19,107 --> 00:03:23,131
Lagbhag aadha second
ruko, thodi randomness ke saath.

53
00:03:23,481 --> 00:03:25,960
Try two: five hundred, server error.

54
00:03:26,180 --> 00:03:28,373
Ab lagbhag ek second ruko.

55
00:03:28,593 --> 00:03:30,258
Wait dugna ho gaya.

56
00:03:30,608 --> 00:03:32,102
Try three: success.

57
00:03:32,322 --> 00:03:33,866
Reply use karo.

58
00:03:35,166 --> 00:03:39,751
Achhi khabar yeh hai ki
Anthropic SDK yeh sab already karta hai.

59
00:03:39,971 --> 00:03:43,144
Max retries se aap isse control karte ho.

60
00:03:43,364 --> 00:03:46,331
Default do hai, aur zero se band hota hai.

61
00:03:46,681 --> 00:03:49,286
Normal case mein call succeed hoti hai.

62
00:03:49,506 --> 00:03:52,883
Ab dekhte hain jab
fake API pehle fail kare.

63
00:03:54,183 --> 00:03:59,038
Yahan fake API pehle four twenty
nine deti hai, phir five hundred.

64
00:03:59,258 --> 00:04:04,941
ANTHROPIC LOG ko info karne se dikhta
hai SDK kya kar raha hai: thoda rukta hai,

65
00:04:04,941 --> 00:04:09,842
retry karta hai, phir thoda zyada
rukta hai, phir retry, aur success.

66
00:04:10,062 --> 00:04:13,219
Hamare code mein ek
bhi extra line nahi lagi.

67
00:04:14,519 --> 00:04:16,574
Production ke kuch aur rules.

68
00:04:16,794 --> 00:04:19,655
Ek timeout set karo
jo aapke liye theek ho.

69
00:04:19,875 --> 00:04:22,237
SDK ka default das minute hai.

70
00:04:22,457 --> 00:04:24,856
Lambe replies ke liye stream karo.

71
00:04:25,206 --> 00:04:27,984
Kuch fail ho, toh request ID log karo.

72
00:04:28,204 --> 00:04:32,231
Isse pata chalta hai
exactly kaunsi request fail hui.

73
00:04:32,581 --> 00:04:38,122
Har app aur environment ki alag key
rakho, taaki ek ko revoke karne se baaki na

74
00:04:38,122 --> 00:04:38,683
tootein.

75
00:04:39,033 --> 00:04:43,258
Aur keys ko kabhi model ko mat
bhejo, na logs mein print karo.

76
00:04:43,478 --> 00:04:47,883
Logs aksar utne protected
nahi hote jitna aap sochte ho.

77
00:04:49,183 --> 00:04:50,262
Ab paisa.

78
00:04:50,482 --> 00:04:53,037
Cost ko bijli ke bill ki tarah socho.

79
00:04:53,257 --> 00:04:57,197
Kitne units use kiye, guna
price per unit, barabar bill.

80
00:04:57,417 --> 00:05:00,457
API mein: tokens guna price per token.

81
00:05:00,677 --> 00:05:03,092
Input aur output ke price alag hain.

82
00:05:03,312 --> 00:05:06,965
Ek call mein bahut thoda,
lekin scale par bahut zyada.

83
00:05:08,265 --> 00:05:14,355
Claude Opus 5.5, sabse capable aur
hamara default: chaar dollar per million input

84
00:05:14,355 --> 00:05:18,115
tokens, aur bees dollar
per million output tokens.

85
00:05:18,465 --> 00:05:20,860
Sonnet 5.5 iska aadha.

86
00:05:21,210 --> 00:05:26,456
Aur Haiku 5.5 bahut sasta hai,
simple aur high volume kaam ke liye.

87
00:05:27,756 --> 00:05:29,820
Yeh raha cost calculation.

88
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:32,046
Prices per million tokens hain.

89
00:05:32,396 --> 00:05:37,079
Count tokens request bhejne
se pehle uska size naap leta hai.

90
00:05:37,299 --> 00:05:41,962
Toh aap bahut badi ya mehengi
request ko pehle hi rok sakte ho.

91
00:05:42,182 --> 00:05:44,333
Output mein: nau input tokens.

92
00:05:44,683 --> 00:05:47,882
Call ke baad usage actual tokens deta hai.

93
00:05:48,102 --> 00:05:52,633
Har ek ko uske price se guna
karo, aur ek million se divide karo.

94
00:05:52,983 --> 00:05:57,521
Aur phir important habit:
apne expected traffic se guna karo.

95
00:05:57,741 --> 00:06:03,637
Ek call ek cent se bhi kam, lekin roz
das hazaar calls, toh har din real paisa.

96
00:06:03,857 --> 00:06:07,236
Offline mode mein yeh token
counts rough estimates hain.

97
00:06:07,456 --> 00:06:09,856
Real key ke saath exact hote hain.

98
00:06:11,156 --> 00:06:13,306
Haath se calculate karte hain.

99
00:06:13,526 --> 00:06:17,144
Input: nau guna chaar
dollar, divided by ek million.

100
00:06:17,494 --> 00:06:21,589
Output: chausath guna bees
dollar, divided by ek million.

101
00:06:21,809 --> 00:06:25,200
Dekho, output ka hissa
input se kaafi bada hai.

102
00:06:25,550 --> 00:06:28,468
Total: lagbhag zero point one three cents.

103
00:06:28,688 --> 00:06:30,546
Ek cent se bhi bahut kam.

104
00:06:30,896 --> 00:06:35,017
Aur das hazaar calls roz:
tera dollar solah cents har din.

105
00:06:35,237 --> 00:06:37,028
Yahi scale ka asar hai.

106
00:06:38,328 --> 00:06:40,552
Cost control ke paanch tareeke.

107
00:06:40,772 --> 00:06:42,311
Pehla: kam bhejo.

108
00:06:42,531 --> 00:06:46,114
History trim karo, sirf
relevant documents daalo.

109
00:06:46,464 --> 00:06:51,130
Doosra: concise answers
maango, sensible max tokens ke saath.

110
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:54,220
Teesra: simple tasks ke liye low effort.

111
00:06:54,570 --> 00:06:58,508
Chautha: sabse chhota model
chuno jo kaam achhe se kare.

112
00:06:58,728 --> 00:07:02,213
Real examples par
measure karke, guess karke nahi.

113
00:07:02,563 --> 00:07:07,822
Aur paanchva: code mein kharcha track
karo, ek budget ke saath jo runaway loops ko

114
00:07:07,822 --> 00:07:08,271
rok de.

115
00:07:08,491 --> 00:07:10,807
Hamara project yahi karta hai.

116
00:07:12,107 --> 00:07:13,566
Interview corner.

117
00:07:13,786 --> 00:07:17,540
Kaun se API errors retry
karne chahiye, aur kaise?

118
00:07:19,890 --> 00:07:25,764
Answer: four twenty nine, five hundred
wale, aur network errors, exponential backoff

119
00:07:25,764 --> 00:07:31,499
aur thodi randomness ke saath, jise
jitter kehte hain, aur attempts ki ek limit ke

120
00:07:31,499 --> 00:07:31,918
saath.

121
00:07:32,138 --> 00:07:35,087
Baaki four hundred wale retry mat karo.

122
00:07:35,307 --> 00:07:38,634
Trap: har error ko ek
tight loop mein retry karna.

123
00:07:38,854 --> 00:07:41,249
Isse server par aur load padta hai.

124
00:07:41,599 --> 00:07:47,149
Doosra question: specific exceptions
ko general se pehle kyun catch karte hain?

125
00:07:49,499 --> 00:07:53,147
Answer: Python pehla
matching except block chalata hai.

126
00:07:53,367 --> 00:07:59,063
API status error jaisi parent
class har HTTP error match karti hai.

127
00:07:59,283 --> 00:08:03,054
Woh pehle aayi, toh specific
handlers kabhi nahi chalenge.

128
00:08:03,274 --> 00:08:07,122
Trap: ek bare except
Exception, jo bugs chhupa deta hai.

129
00:08:08,422 --> 00:08:09,679
Practice time.

130
00:08:10,029 --> 00:08:11,704
Pehla: four oh one aaya.

131
00:08:11,924 --> 00:08:13,832
Retry karoge ya fix?

132
00:08:14,052 --> 00:08:14,767
Kyun?

133
00:08:15,117 --> 00:08:21,764
Doosra: Opus 5.5 par do hazaar input
aur paanch sau output tokens ki cost kitni

134
00:08:21,764 --> 00:08:22,185
hogi?

135
00:08:22,535 --> 00:08:27,462
Teesra: ek loop likho jo teen baar
retry kare, har baar dugna wait karke.

136
00:08:27,812 --> 00:08:31,396
Aur scenario: raat bhar
mein aapka bill double ho gaya.

137
00:08:31,616 --> 00:08:34,229
Teen cheezein batao jo aap check karoge.

138
00:08:41,529 --> 00:08:42,457
Quick check.

139
00:08:42,677 --> 00:08:45,834
Inn mein se kaunsa
error retry karna chahiye?

140
00:08:51,534 --> 00:08:53,048
Four twenty nine.

141
00:08:53,268 --> 00:08:56,121
Rate limit rukne ke
baad theek ho jaati hai.

142
00:08:56,341 --> 00:09:01,755
Baaki har baar same tareeke se fail
honge, jab tak request ya key theek na ho.

143
00:09:03,055 --> 00:09:03,895
Recap.

144
00:09:04,115 --> 00:09:09,607
Four hundred wale errors, four twenty
nine ko chhodkar, fix maangte hain, retry

145
00:09:09,607 --> 00:09:09,954
nahi.

146
00:09:10,304 --> 00:09:16,122
Rate limits, server errors, aur network
errors backoff ke saath retry hote hain, aur

147
00:09:16,122 --> 00:09:17,714
SDK yeh khud karta hai.

148
00:09:18,064 --> 00:09:22,196
Specific exception classes
ko general se pehle catch karo.

149
00:09:22,546 --> 00:09:24,845
Aur cost hai tokens guna price.

150
00:09:25,065 --> 00:09:27,899
Toh count karo, track
karo, aur budget rakho.

151
00:09:28,249 --> 00:09:31,223
Ab project ke liye
sab kuch aapko pata hai.

152
00:09:31,443 --> 00:09:35,454
Agle lesson mein AI Study
Assistant banana shuru karenge.
